      "text": "PK  userUid          CHAR(36)\nREL roleUid          CHAR(36) → userRole.roleUid\n    fullName         VARCHAR(120)\nUQ  email            VARCHAR(254)\n    passwordHash     VARCHAR(255)\n    emailVerified    BOOLEAN DEFAULT false\n    emailVerifiedAt  DATETIME(3) NULL\n    isActive         BOOLEAN DEFAULT true\n    isDeleted        BOOLEAN DEFAULT false\n    lastLoginAt      DATETIME(3) NULL\n    createdAt        DATETIME(3) UTC\n    updatedAt        DATETIME(3) UTC\n\nIDX ukUserMasterEmail (email)\nIDX idxUserMasterRoleUid (roleUid)\nIDX idxUserMasterStatus (isActive, isDeleted)\nIDX idxUserMasterFullName (fullName)",
