      "text": "PK  permissionUid    CHAR(36)\nREL roleUid          CHAR(36) → userRole.roleUid\nREL menuUid          CHAR(36) NULL → menuMaster.menuUid\n    permissionName   VARCHAR(120)\n    permissionCode   VARCHAR(120)\n    httpMethod       ENUM(GET, POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE)\n    apiPath          VARCHAR(255) route template\n    isAllowed        BOOLEAN DEFAULT true\n    isActive         BOOLEAN DEFAULT true\n    isDeleted        BOOLEAN DEFAULT false\n    createdAt        DATETIME(3) UTC\n    updatedAt        DATETIME(3) UTC\n\nUQ  (roleUid, httpMethod, apiPath)\nUQ  (roleUid, permissionCode)\nIDX idxPermissionMasterMenuUid (menuUid)\nIDX idxPermissionMasterLookup\n    (roleUid, isAllowed, isActive, isDeleted)\n\nIssuer + Investor seed: GET menu list / detail",
      "rawText": "PK  permissionUid    CHAR(36)\nREL roleUid          CHAR(36) → userRole.roleUid\nREL menuUid          CHAR(36) NULL → menuMaster.menuUid\n    permissionName   VARCHAR(120)\n    permissionCode   VARCHAR(120)\n    httpMethod       ENUM(GET, POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE)\n    apiPath          VARCHAR(255) route template\n    isAllowed        BOOLEAN DEFAULT true\n    isActive         BOOLEAN DEFAULT true\n    isDeleted        BOOLEAN DEFAULT false\n    createdAt        DATETIME(3) UTC\n    updatedAt        DATETIME(3) UTC\n\nUQ  (roleUid, httpMethod, apiPath)\nUQ  (roleUid, permissionCode)\nIDX idxPermissionMasterMenuUid (menuUid)\nIDX idxPermissionMasterLookup\n    (roleUid, isAllowed, isActive, isDeleted)\n\nIssuer + Investor seed: GET menu list / detail",
