      "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "investorClaimSubmission\n\nPK submissionUid\nUQ interestUid + claimSignatureUid\nUQ txHash + logIndex\nREL investorUid → investorMaster\nREL interestUid → tokenInvestmentInterest\nREL claimSignatureUid → issuerClaimSignature\nclaimTopic, data, signature\ninvestorIdentityAddress, issuerIdentityAddress\npreparedAtBlock, lastScannedBlock\ntxHash, blockNumber, transactionIndex, logIndex\nstatus: PENDING | CONFIRMED | FAILED\nsyncStatus: IDLE | QUEUED | PROCESSING | FAILED\nsync timestamps, attempts, failure, nextSyncAt\ncreatedAt, updatedAt",
      "rawText": "investorClaimSubmission\n\nPK submissionUid\nUQ interestUid + claimSignatureUid\nUQ txHash + logIndex\nREL investorUid → investorMaster\nREL interestUid → tokenInvestmentInterest\nREL claimSignatureUid → issuerClaimSignature\nclaimTopic, data, signature\ninvestorIdentityAddress, issuerIdentityAddress\npreparedAtBlock, lastScannedBlock\ntxHash, blockNumber, transactionIndex, logIndex\nstatus: PENDING | CONFIRMED | FAILED\nsyncStatus: IDLE | QUEUED | PROCESSING | FAILED\nsync timestamps, attempts, failure, nextSyncAt\ncreatedAt, updatedAt",
